  "requiredRemediations": [
    "Seal V272 inbox and outbox INSERT and UPDATE state machines against NULL-check bypass, forged terminal evidence, early claims, stale results, invalid retry bounds and non-RESULT_UNKNOWN terminal states.",
    "Use database time and exact owner, attempt and claim fences for relay claim, pre-I/O recheck and result CAS; expired attempt ten must become immutable RESULT_UNKNOWN.",
    "Permit admitted durable work and callbacks to drain after quiesce and short proof expiry while rejecting revoked or cut-over authority; preserve exact root-delivery and terminal-child lineage.",
    "Return the exact persisted admission body and digest on replay while issuing a fresh current-owner detached proof.",
    "Reject TLS versions below 1.3, wrong DNS, wrong SPIFFE, invalid revocation and unbound client credentials before any callback body byte is sent.",
    "Reload the external credential lease immediately before I/O and compare lease identity, version, digest, grant, local role, key and certificate binding.",
    "Replace LIMIT-100 starvation with stable bounded keyset pagination so tenant 101 is eventually serviced.",
    "Persist a per-person revocation watermark and append-only history even when no identity exists; delayed ACTIVE or PENDING synchronization must fail closed until a separately authorized monotonic REHIRE supersedes it.",
    "Produce and wire Auth CALLER and OWNER signed zero-pending identity rotation-readiness evidence from repeatable-read snapshots, treating unresolved DEAD or RESULT_UNKNOWN as pending.",
    "Evaluate effective dates using com_tenants.time_zone rather than the database session date.",
    "Quarantine permanent poison work without head-of-line blocking and isolate per-tenant relay claim failures.",
    "Add bounded proof-replay cleanup without permitting arbitrary replay deletion.",
    "Prove the actual executor, scheduler, readiness and negative runtime-role paths omitted by the reviewed evidence."
  ],
